{
  "name": "fuse-studio-plugin",
  "version": "2.5.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Roblox engineering skills and local knowledge MCP for Claude Code, Antigravity and Codex",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test tests/*.test.mjs",
    "check": "node scripts/check.mjs",
    "benchmark": "node scripts/benchmark.mjs",
    "asset-audit": "node scripts/audit-stud-assets.mjs",
    "refs:search": "node scripts/search-visual-refs.mjs",
    "refs:stats": "node scripts/search-visual-refs.mjs --stats",
    "refs:update": "node scripts/update-visual-catalog.mjs"
  }
}

For Stud UI examples that formerly depended on failing image IDs, the Fuse native icon fallback module is now `StudNativeIcons.luau`. It draws basket, gamepad, currency and neutral social elements with built-in Roblox GUI. Use `StudUISafe` + `StudIconsSafe` rather than the original module entrypoints when creating new GUI. See [the asset audit guide](stud-asset-audit.md).
